Clinic locations

Edit src/data/locations.js.

The same code supports:

export const locations = [];

0 clinics → clean empty-state map section.

export const locations = [clinic1];

1 clinic → one marker and one clinic card.

export const locations = [clinic1, clinic2, clinic3];

Multiple clinics → all markers/cards are rendered automatically.

Each location should contain:

{
  id: "central",
  name: "Clinic Name",
  address: "Full address",
  phone: "+91 ...",
  hours: "Mon – Sat · 8:00 AM – 8:00 PM",
  latitude: 28.6139,
  longitude: 77.2090,
  mapUrl: "https://www.google.com/maps/..."
}

Use the clinic's real latitude/longitude. The map uses the coordinates for markers; mapUrl is used for directions.

